# ===============================================================
# PRIVATE RESEARCH NOTES - this repository is PUBLIC.
# Literature reviews, research plans, meeting notes and agent
# handoff docs stay local. pixel-diffusion/.gitignore covers the
# same names one level down; these are the repo-wide rules so a
# note dropped in any directory is ignored by default.
# Do NOT un-ignore. Prefer adding a pattern here over trusting
# yourself to remember at `git add` time.
#
# These are symlinks into ../ambient-omni-private-notes, so the
# patterns are written WITHOUT a trailing slash: a trailing slash
# matches directories only and would silently stop matching the
# moment a directory became a symlink.
# Restore the links with pixel-diffusion/scripts/restore_private_notes.sh
# ===============================================================
lit_review
**/lit_review
lit_review/
**/lit_review/
context.md
**/context.md
HANDOFF.md
**/HANDOFF.md
notes/
**/notes/
*_notes.md
*_private.md
meeting*.md
**/meeting*.md
research_plan*.md
**/research_plan*.md
